ys \"R04 修訂性質（bounded repair）\". If I keep it, that's the same heading style as the R04 note in R05. The R03 note became （歷史）when R04 was created. So it does seem like they demote. Let me check: was the R03 heading originally \"（bounded repair）\" in R03 file? Let me check R03/R04 files to see the pattern of heading changes across revisions. That will tell me the established convention.\n\nLet me read the top of R03 and R04 files.",
